    "description": {
      "value": "<p><b>Discovery Domain · уровень 3</b></p><p>You are trained for long travel, navigation, and fighting across coasts, rivers, and open water.<br>Bonus Proficiencies. You gain proficiency with Martial<br>Weapons, Cartographer’s Tools, and Navigator’s Tools.<br>Eye of the Navigator. When someone makes a History,<br>Survival, or Perception check to locate or learn where a place is, you can choose to give them a +5 bonus to their roll. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Wisdom Modifier, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest<br>Powerful Swimmer. You have a Swim Speed equal to your Speed, and you can hold your breath for twice as long as normal.</p><hr><p><b>Автоматизация / ограничения:</b></p><ul><li>Бонус +5 применить к подходящей проверке после активации.</li></ul>"
